		{"viewend"},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050b"},
		line=543,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"When I get back to the shop, I spot Akari looking out through the second-floor window.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shouldn't you be sleeping?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I tried, but I couldn't fall asleep.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You really should go and lie down.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Akari only nods vaguely in response to my words.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You agreed to train me in blade arts, remember?”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you don't mind, can we start right now?”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Right now? What's the rush?”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I just feel like training right now.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wanna work up a sweat.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Neither Akari nor I have slept since yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Training would be pointless, given our current state.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"No, Akari probably knows that perfectly well, but she's still asking this of me.",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Which means she must have some ulterior motive.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You got it, but just a little.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haaah!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"I receive Akari's sharp strike head-on.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaah!”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"As though trying to shatter her own weapon, Akari launches a frantic flurry of forceful blows.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"I parry each of her strikes.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"She tumbles forward to the ground, unable to arrest her own momentum.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I've still got more!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Akari leaps to her feet with vigor.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"We've already been at this for over an hour.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"I'm impressed by her dauntless endurance, but as training, this is entirely meaningless.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"Training is only meaningful when your nerves are attuned with each movement of your body.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Teiii!”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nngh!”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"I block her blade and use my weight to turn it aside.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Akari falls flat on her back.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"But she immediately picks herself back up once again.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's stop here. You'll only hurt yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not done yet!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"She reassumes a ready position, her blade pointed right between my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you seriously even trying to practice, or are you just here to let out steam?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What's it matter to you!?”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“*Cough!* Haah, haah, haah...”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Another thirty minutes have elapsed.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Akari is sprawled out spread-eagle on the dojo floor.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I crouch down next to her.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Did any of your old wounds reopen?”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't... don't think so... Haah... haah.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Looks like you... haven't even broken a sweat.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“An ordinary person really has no hope of keeping up with a warrior, huh? I get that, but it's still frustrating...”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll go get you some water.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"When I try to head to the fountain outside, Akari grabs me by the edge of my sleeve.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. Don't go.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You need to stay hydrated.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine, really.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"Akari is being unusually stubborn.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"She's holding on tight and refusing to let go.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seriously, what's with you today?”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's... It's nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Leaving it at that, Akari falls silent.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I come to train at the usual time.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I didn't get very much sleep, but I'll feel restless for the whole rest of the day if I skip my training.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I'm sure Soujin feels the same way.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Eeeeeeiii!”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"I hear a woman's voice ringing out from the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Moments later, I hear Soujin's voice rise up to meet hers.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Miyaguni? Soujin?)”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Oh... they're training together.)”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"A chilly hollowness spreads throughout my chest, and I freeze in place where I stand.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"For some strange reason, this simple realization dealt a heavy blow to me.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Ah, that's why...)”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"The dojo is our special place, reserved just for the two of us.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"When I realize that, an indescribable sense of listlessness envelops my entire body.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Unbidden, I recall the intense desperation on Soujin's face when we were flying to Miyaguni's rescue.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Would he come to my rescue like that if I were kidnapped?)”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"My head is swimming with these worthless thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Before he met Miyaguni, I would have bet my life that he'd surely come to my aid...",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(What should I do? Should I even go to the dojo?)”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I'm at a loss.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"I'd just be getting between the two of them.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"But wait. I should have the right to train as well.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"The dojo is a public space, after all.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"I steel myself and make for the dojo.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Haaah!”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"A voice drifts out through the open window.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"I surreptitiously peek inside and spot the two facing off against each other.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Their blades are locked in union, and their faces are close enough to tickle each other with their breaths.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The dojo is supposed to be my and Soujin's sacred place...",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(I never should've come here...)”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"I squeeze my eyes shut and turn to avert my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"The gravel crunches beneath my feet, and I worry that Soujin might've noticed.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"It's like I'm running away, pure and simple.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“You have no reason to run, child.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Huh?)”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"A voice rings in my ears from out of nowhere and stops me in my tracks.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Now, who was it that watched over him all this time?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That was... me...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Unthinkingly, I answer aloud.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Yes. It was you.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“That makes you the only one worthy to be by his side.\nIsn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's right.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Putting voice to my innermost thoughts makes me feel strangely refreshed.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"The hazy feeling clouding my chest is clearing up.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“And yet... someone would stand in your way.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Someone would take your rightful place next to the one you hold most dear.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Who dares? Who dares to usurp that which is rightfully yours?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Miyaguni... Miyaguni Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“That’s right, my dear.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“You know... if you permit things to stay as they are, she will steal him away for good.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“There is nothing more pathetic than a woman who has her man taken away from her.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Would you accept such an outcome?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No... It's not right...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“I can't hear you.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Say it. Can you accept it?”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Say it again, dear. Say it louder.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I nearly scream aloud, “It's not right!”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"No... my head is the only thing that's not right here.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"This is ridiculous. What am I even thinking?",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I shake my head over and over, trying to dispel this haze of drowsiness.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Just what was that voice I heard?",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"A hallucination conjured by my negative emotions?",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"For a hallucination, it seemed strangely vivid, not to mention somehow familiar...",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I'm inexplicably reminded of a certain spellblade, tucked away in the back corner of the arsenal.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(It couldn't be...)”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"It has to be my imagination.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Going so crazy with jealousy as to imagine a talking blade? This must be some sort of sick joke.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"I'm not alright. I'm seriously not alright today.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I'll go cool my head and come back tomorrow.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"With my mind made up, I put the Imperial Temple behind me.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
